  "id": "https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Burmese Dogs",
  "summary": "\u003cblockquote\u003e\"The pariah curs were baying the moon - it was only a quarter full\nand nearly down by midnight, but the dogs slept all day in the heat, and they\nhad begun their moon-choruses already\" \u003cfooter class=\"bq\"\u003e- George Orwell\u003c/footer\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-01.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cblockquote\u003e\"The pariah curs were baying the moon - it was only a quarter full\nand nearly down by midnight, but the dogs slept all day in the heat, and they\nhad begun their moon-choruses already\" \u003cfooter class=\"bq\"\u003e- George Orwell\u003c/footer\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-01.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt was on the first night of the 3 day trek from Kalaw to Inle Lake, in a small\nhilltop village, at about 4 a.m when, as we discovered later in the morning, we\nhad all been awoken by the \u003ci\u003emoon-choruses\u003c/i\u003e of a group of dogs that must\nhave been larger than the human population of the town.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a series of photos I took with my phone while travelling around Burma\nduring July 2018. I found the similarities between Burma as I visited it and how\nGeorge Orwell wrote about it to be quite interesting, especially with regards to\nthe dogs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-02.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-03.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-04.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-05.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-06.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-07.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-08.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-09.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-10.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-11.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://samsm.ch/burmese-dogs/burmese-dogs-12.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \n\u003c/figure\u003e",
